    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Long Tan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116923881127569802097/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKv7tH0EeXgOj4FrJ_oyEGBdiaxda-TajyffZbO7JD4_ls2utM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We had a wonderful experience at Addiction Tattoos & Piercings!\nThe piercer was very professional and patient. My two daughters (5 and 7 years old) got their ears pierced and didn’t cry at all — the piercer’s hands were gentle and steady, and everything was done so quickly and cleanly.\nHe also took the time to explain how to take care of the piercings afterward.\nWe are very happy and highly recommend this place for kids and families.",
        "time": 1762088122,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sarah Sokol",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115079308629888610888/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3EUBBvAKr83HbAJWVpnxSAqkxjK9SrOBvBqFVohvHEwpk6g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Called ahead for baby ear piercing and was seen the same day. My daughter is six months old and didn’t even cry! Super clean, super fast and perfectly even piercings. They have plenty of earring styles to choose from with different price ranges. The piercer was a dad and super calm and gentle with my little one. He used a single-use piercing gun, so sure to be sterile and clean. I will recommend this location for friends and family who are looking to do ear piercing.",
        "time": 1758844733,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sarah Gordon-Loiello",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102292375606884217900/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX34Ez2HSbsFVvKTMH5rEGj-QwKmFtKuQ1uibGwSqMT5ygmzk8O=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "We had a great experience getting my 4 year old daughter's ears pierced at Addictions Tattoos. Both workers were extremely kind and helpful. They took the time to explain everything they were doing, to my daughter. They took time to double check the placement of the earrings multiple times before doing the piercings. She had both earrings done at the same time with no tears. Highly recommend. Thank you",
        "time": 1758635858,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria Gardner",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118031095334572084486/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1WuPTQ1V1uMFcCi0nO3DbZvTflp8beUCwgtj6_ymboYTxgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "By far the best tattoo shop I’ve ever been to!! All artists were kind and welcoming, as well as helpful answering all my questions, 10/10 recommend coming in if your in the area you will be happy with your outcome. The shop is also very clean and well taken care of!!",
        "time": 1766868824,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leila Douglas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100254587137342429555/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI38_57G2mked6OSAsQMBeerVMzcFkzT2W4Z-UfGP0LbiG4ng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I went for an ear piercing and had a great experience. The piercer was very\nprofessional, helpful and patient as I was a little nervous. I love the results!! Its a great place for young kids too because they have a wide selection of great jewelry",
